  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: fc6d04f2b86358b489f302cbf785df47, type: 3}
  texts:
  - The world descended into ruin when particles of the star ____ fell on Earth.
  - its powerful radioactive energy turning animals into mutations, humans into liquids,
    and causing 60% of the population to die within the first six months.
  - 'The world began to split into two factions: one technological, fighting the
    mutations with advanced technology, and the other barbaric, experimenting on
    animals and humans to create animal weapons.'
  - One of the laboratories of the barbaric faction exploded due to a failed experiment,
    and only one survived, an individual with a human body connected to tubes, likely
    the cause of the entire incident."
  imageComponent: {fileID: 1478922133}
  textComponent: {fileID: 1004710481}
